1
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:28,120
♪I scaled sheer cliffs for lingzhi,
then found you gathering moonlight♪

2
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:33,420
♪Two baskets of silver glow
rang out like stone against steel♪

3
00:00:33,810 --> 00:00:37,100
♪You said to cure me of my hesitation♪

4
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:39,930
♪I'd need nine measures
of wind from the cliffs♪

5
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:45,280
♪And three measures of a heartbeat
that stops when our eyes meet♪

6
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:49,900
♪I caught your wrist and said♪

7
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:54,450
♪This condition is already beyond cure♪

8
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:56,860
=Hanyi Enters The Heart=

9
00:00:56,860 --> 00:00:59,780
=Episode 5=

10
00:01:02,830 --> 00:01:03,740
Use the golden needles as the key

11
00:01:04,230 --> 00:01:05,180
and the Noble Consort as the means

12
00:01:05,910 --> 00:01:07,020
to strike directly
at Cui Hong's weak point.

13
00:01:07,470 --> 00:01:09,150
This is an excellent plan.

14
00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:11,100
However,

15
00:01:11,720 --> 00:01:13,200
Noble Consort Cui has lived
deep within the palace for years

16
00:01:13,200 --> 00:01:14,340
and is difficult to read.

17
00:01:15,060 --> 00:01:16,900
Will she trust a wandering female
medical attendant like me?

18
00:01:17,660 --> 00:01:18,750
What she wants isn't trust.

19
00:01:20,110 --> 00:01:20,700
It's freedom.

20
00:01:21,310 --> 00:01:21,950
And you

21
00:01:22,700 --> 00:01:24,750
are the only one
who can free her from her suffering.

22
00:01:26,380 --> 00:01:28,020
The palace may appear
full of beauty and splendor,

23
00:01:28,860 --> 00:01:30,580
but in truth, it is a vast prison,

24
00:01:31,260 --> 00:01:33,110
holding countless women
who have no say in their own lives.

25
00:01:34,470 --> 00:01:34,900
And you

26
00:01:36,430 --> 00:01:38,350
must look beyond all that beauty

27
00:01:39,710 --> 00:01:41,430
and see the hidden currents beneath it.

28
00:01:42,350 --> 00:01:44,110
Amid all the laughter and cheer,

29
00:01:44,670 --> 00:01:45,500
you must discern truth from falsehood.

30
00:01:46,620 --> 00:01:48,180
(Even if it's fraught with danger,)

31
00:01:48,980 --> 00:01:50,430
(I still have to venture in.)

32
00:02:05,110 --> 00:02:05,700
Your Highness.

33
00:02:05,700 --> 00:02:06,470
(Noble Consort Cui, Cui Rongyin)

34
00:02:06,470 --> 00:02:08,590
This is the woman
Censor Zheng recommended,

35
00:02:08,620 --> 00:02:10,620
Medical Attendant Gu Hanyi
from Jiangnan.

36
00:02:11,390 --> 00:02:12,510
I am Gu Hanyi.

37
00:02:12,780 --> 00:02:14,310
Greetings, Your Highness.

38
00:02:16,670 --> 00:02:17,700
Raise your head.

39
00:02:24,140 --> 00:02:26,310
These headaches
have tormented me for a long time.

40
00:02:26,950 --> 00:02:28,780
When they strike,
the pain cuts straight to the bone.

41
00:02:29,830 --> 00:02:32,420
The Imperial Medical Service
keeps prescribing much the same remedies.

42
00:02:33,780 --> 00:02:35,110
If you truly can cure me,

43
00:02:36,030 --> 00:02:37,420
you will be richly rewarded.

44
00:02:39,670 --> 00:02:41,140
I will do my utmost.

45
00:02:42,030 --> 00:02:43,510
(When Noble Consort Cui was sixteen,)

46
00:02:43,590 --> 00:02:45,030
(Cui Hong
recommended her for the palace.)

47
00:02:45,420 --> 00:02:47,950
(Rumor has it that the two have
been at odds in recent years.)

48
00:02:48,750 --> 00:02:50,060
(I must use the rift between them)

49
00:02:50,420 --> 00:02:51,900
(to find evidence of Cui Hong's crimes.)

50
00:02:53,260 --> 00:02:55,900
Your Highness, your condition
stems from pent-up worries

51
00:02:56,390 --> 00:02:57,700
that have disrupted
the flow of your qi and blood.

52
00:02:58,030 --> 00:02:59,110
Golden needles can restore circulation,

53
00:02:59,260 --> 00:03:00,540
while incense can calm the mind.

54
00:03:01,180 --> 00:03:03,870
But to cure it completely,

55
00:03:04,310 --> 00:03:05,300
you must also find peace of mind.

56
00:03:06,740 --> 00:03:07,910
Peace of mind?

57
00:03:08,910 --> 00:03:10,300
Deep within this palace,

58
00:03:10,540 --> 00:03:11,830
where could I possibly find peace?

59
00:03:15,580 --> 00:03:17,190
You said you came from Jiangnan.

60
00:03:18,700 --> 00:03:19,540
Jiangnan...

61
00:03:19,950 --> 00:03:21,540
I once heard my brother speak of it.

62
00:03:22,630 --> 00:03:24,670
He said spring there
is bursting with color,

63
00:03:25,260 --> 00:03:27,420
and even in winter,
flowers still bloom on the trees.

64
00:03:28,140 --> 00:03:29,460
It's nothing like the Capital,

65
00:03:30,190 --> 00:03:31,460
much less this palace,

66
00:03:32,910 --> 00:03:35,230
where every season
carries a certain chill.

67
00:03:35,790 --> 00:03:36,630
(I know what to do.)

68
00:03:37,140 --> 00:03:37,910
How dull.

69
00:03:40,540 --> 00:03:42,140
If Your Highness doesn't mind,

70
00:03:42,460 --> 00:03:44,230
I can come at this time every day

71
00:03:44,510 --> 00:03:45,910
to treat you with acupuncture

72
00:03:46,420 --> 00:03:47,460
and tell you

73
00:03:47,460 --> 00:03:49,070
some amusing tales
of everyday life in Jiangnan.

74
00:03:50,700 --> 00:03:51,300
Very well.

75
00:03:52,140 --> 00:03:53,790
Come and keep me company more often.

76
00:03:54,350 --> 00:03:56,020
Tell me stories about Jiangnan

77
00:03:56,670 --> 00:03:57,950
to help relieve my boredom.

78
00:03:58,580 --> 00:03:59,110
Yes.

79
00:03:59,690 --> 00:04:00,560
As you command.

80
00:04:01,450 --> 00:04:03,070
Then I shall take my leave.

81
00:04:15,740 --> 00:04:17,420
Back then, one breathtaking dance

82
00:04:18,070 --> 00:04:19,740
captivated the entire realm.

83
00:04:19,860 --> 00:04:20,540
Your Highness.

84
00:04:21,110 --> 00:04:22,300
Let's go back.

85
00:04:23,390 --> 00:04:24,190
Who is she?

86
00:04:24,700 --> 00:04:25,700
Medical Attendant Gu,

87
00:04:26,070 --> 00:04:27,140
this is Noble Consort Yang.

88
00:04:27,510 --> 00:04:29,190
Lord Cui introduced her
to the palace last year,

89
00:04:29,540 --> 00:04:31,460
but His Majesty has yet to favor her.

90
00:04:31,740 --> 00:04:35,340
(Noble Consort Yang, Yang Yuzhen)

91
00:04:35,350 --> 00:04:36,860
Does Your Majesty still remember?

92
00:04:37,540 --> 00:04:39,630
Back then, you said
my breathtaking dance

93
00:04:40,140 --> 00:04:41,830
could captivate the entire realm.

94
00:04:43,230 --> 00:04:44,510
Now, does this dance

95
00:04:44,860 --> 00:04:47,070
still please Your Majesty?

96
00:04:52,790 --> 00:04:54,910
I'm afraid Your Majesty
has long forgotten

97
00:04:55,630 --> 00:04:58,910
that someone from the past
still remains deep within this palace.

98
00:05:01,630 --> 00:05:03,300
(It's Cui Hong again.)

99
00:05:03,980 --> 00:05:05,700
(Subtle Fragrance, Sparse Shadows)
Women in the palace

100
00:05:05,700 --> 00:05:06,910
are all like birds in a cage.

101
00:05:08,670 --> 00:05:09,630
Favored today,

102
00:05:10,420 --> 00:05:11,420
forgotten tomorrow.

103
00:05:13,950 --> 00:05:14,990
Pity

104
00:05:16,310 --> 00:05:17,310
can cloud your judgment.

105
00:05:22,260 --> 00:05:23,460
As for Noble Consort Cui,

106
00:05:25,100 --> 00:05:26,190
how do you plan to proceed?

107
00:05:28,190 --> 00:05:29,990
Noble Consort Cui
has begun to lower her guard.

108
00:05:30,510 --> 00:05:32,700
I can use this chance
to gather evidence of Cui Hong's crimes.

109
00:05:33,070 --> 00:05:34,990
She now depends on my golden needles
and medicinal incense.

110
00:05:35,430 --> 00:05:36,830
Under the guise
of restoring her circulation,

111
00:05:37,310 --> 00:05:39,700
I can use a specially prepared incense
to leave her mind hazy.

112
00:05:40,260 --> 00:05:41,830
While she drifts
between waking and sleep,

113
00:05:42,310 --> 00:05:43,510
she may reveal Cui Hong's secrets.

114
00:05:45,550 --> 00:05:48,990
Cui Hong has been secretly
dealing with border tribes

115
00:05:49,390 --> 00:05:50,340
and smuggling medicinal herbs.

116
00:05:51,550 --> 00:05:53,260
His cousin Liu Xian in Jiangnan

117
00:05:54,020 --> 00:05:55,310
is responsible
for securing the trade routes.

118
00:05:58,260 --> 00:05:59,900
If we can obtain proof of his crimes,

119
00:06:01,140 --> 00:06:04,100
we can certainly
convict him of corruption.

120
00:06:09,340 --> 00:06:10,260
You wretched girl!

121
00:06:10,550 --> 00:06:11,580
Do you not understand

122
00:06:11,580 --> 00:06:12,660
what I told you?

123
00:06:13,780 --> 00:06:14,430
Chuchu.

124
00:06:15,070 --> 00:06:17,020
You were told to collect
floral dew for Her Highness,

125
00:06:17,550 --> 00:06:19,220
yet you used such a crude jar.

126
00:06:19,630 --> 00:06:21,190
You're clearly neglecting
your duties on purpose.

127
00:06:21,550 --> 00:06:22,260
I wouldn't dare.

128
00:06:22,750 --> 00:06:24,780
The... The jade bottle I used before

129
00:06:24,990 --> 00:06:26,390
was taken by you...

130
00:06:26,510 --> 00:06:27,340
How dare you talk back!

131
00:06:29,140 --> 00:06:30,550
Medical Attendant Gu, stay out of this.

132
00:06:30,630 --> 00:06:32,660
- Madam Rong is the Noble Consort's favorite.
- That's for talking back!

133
00:06:32,990 --> 00:06:34,220
- She holds a great deal of power.
- Madam, I was wrong.

134
00:06:34,220 --> 00:06:35,060
That's for talking back!

135
00:06:35,220 --> 00:06:36,600
- As for Chuchu,
- I won't do it again.

136
00:06:36,630 --> 00:06:38,460
- lowly palace maids like us
- I'll beat you to death!

137
00:06:38,660 --> 00:06:39,440
- are already used to this.
- I was wrong.

138
00:06:39,440 --> 00:06:40,870
- Once she tires herself out,
- You can't even collect floral dew.

139
00:06:41,220 --> 00:06:42,630
- she'll naturally stop.
- What use are you?

140
00:06:44,310 --> 00:06:45,340
No one is born

141
00:06:46,260 --> 00:06:47,700
above or beneath another.

142
00:06:48,340 --> 00:06:49,070
Medical Attendant Gu.

143
00:06:49,260 --> 00:06:50,580
Noble Consort is still waiting for you.

144
00:06:51,070 --> 00:06:51,950
We should go.

145
00:06:52,900 --> 00:06:53,870
I was wrong.

146
00:06:53,990 --> 00:06:55,100
I was wrong.

147
00:07:02,900 --> 00:07:04,310
Your Highness's pulse
is heavy and troubled.

148
00:07:04,580 --> 00:07:06,140
It seems years of worry
have taken a toll on your health.

149
00:07:07,340 --> 00:07:09,870
Do you often worry about your family?

150
00:07:12,750 --> 00:07:14,700
I worry about my family,

151
00:07:15,950 --> 00:07:18,140
but have they ever worried about me?

152
00:07:20,340 --> 00:07:23,340
My brother is busy dealing
with those border tribes.

153
00:07:24,750 --> 00:07:26,460
Has he ever remembered

154
00:07:26,460 --> 00:07:28,510
that he has an unfavored sister
trapped deep within the palace?

155
00:07:30,580 --> 00:07:32,580
To him, I'm nothing more than

156
00:07:32,580 --> 00:07:34,390
a jewel adorning his scepter.

157
00:07:38,460 --> 00:07:39,510
I would think

158
00:07:40,190 --> 00:07:41,390
perhaps the Grand Secretary

159
00:07:41,830 --> 00:07:43,700
has reasons
that leave him little choice.

160
00:07:45,510 --> 00:07:48,660
My brother's ambitions go far
beyond the Grand Secretariat.

161
00:07:49,900 --> 00:07:52,260
He wants complete
control over the Six Ministries

162
00:07:53,430 --> 00:07:55,660
and the authority to act as regent

163
00:07:56,780 --> 00:07:58,510
whenever His Majesty
is absent from state affairs.

164
00:08:01,140 --> 00:08:02,070
His Majesty

165
00:08:03,660 --> 00:08:06,100
has never truly favored me.

166
00:08:07,630 --> 00:08:08,580
(Since entering the palace,)

167
00:08:08,750 --> 00:08:10,220
(she has never received
the Emperor's favor.)

168
00:08:11,630 --> 00:08:12,750
This is Noble Consort Yang.

169
00:08:13,020 --> 00:08:14,780
Lord Cui introduced her
to the palace last year,

170
00:08:15,140 --> 00:08:17,070
but His Majesty has yet to favor her.

171
00:08:17,990 --> 00:08:19,630
The palace may appear
full of beauty and splendor,

172
00:08:19,780 --> 00:08:22,460
but in truth, it is a vast prison,

173
00:08:23,100 --> 00:08:24,900
holding countless women
who have no say in their own lives.

174
00:08:32,580 --> 00:08:33,950
What did I just say?

175
00:08:37,100 --> 00:08:39,070
Your Highness said
you were feeling a little tired.

176
00:08:39,550 --> 00:08:40,100
As it happens,

177
00:08:40,430 --> 00:08:41,900
today's acupuncture treatment
is complete.

178
00:08:42,140 --> 00:08:43,220
Please get some rest.

179
00:08:50,580 --> 00:08:52,100
I shall take my leave.

180
00:08:56,070 --> 00:08:56,750
(Master,)

181
00:08:57,830 --> 00:08:59,550
(I've found a way
to deal with Cui Hong.)

182
00:09:07,660 --> 00:09:08,550
Word has come from the palace.

183
00:09:09,260 --> 00:09:11,020
Cui Hong has begun searching
for another candidate

184
00:09:12,830 --> 00:09:14,660
to divide Noble Consort Cui's favor.

185
00:09:16,990 --> 00:09:17,830
Just as expected.

186
00:09:18,430 --> 00:09:20,900
After all, His Majesty has never
truly favored Noble Consort Cui.

187
00:09:28,340 --> 00:09:29,460
There's talk in the palace

188
00:09:29,700 --> 00:09:32,030
that Cui Hong owns
a private residence in Yongning Ward,

189
00:09:32,220 --> 00:09:33,670
where many women are being held captive.

190
00:09:35,980 --> 00:09:37,190
I can use my work as a physician

191
00:09:37,550 --> 00:09:38,550
as a pretext
to investigate Yongning Ward.

192
00:09:56,250 --> 00:09:59,110
♪Every step is hard,
every step fraught with danger♪

193
00:09:59,870 --> 00:10:02,810
♪Every step is a battle with no retreat♪

194
00:10:03,470 --> 00:10:06,290
♪As dawn approaches, those still asleep♪

195
00:10:07,140 --> 00:10:10,130
♪Know nothing
of the bitter cold of the long night♪

196
00:10:10,980 --> 00:10:14,300
♪If fate had not woven its threads
and spurred everything along♪

197
00:10:14,640 --> 00:10:17,930
♪How could we witness life's upheavals
and the passing of time?♪

198
00:10:18,280 --> 00:10:24,760
♪If this grand dream is destined to
be absurd, with no answer to be found♪

199
00:10:25,550 --> 00:10:32,640
♪How I wish that when I wake,
I could still be by your side♪

200
00:10:35,140 --> 00:10:42,990
♪However distant the past,
however far the future♪

201
00:10:43,290 --> 00:10:45,100
♪I stand here today♪

202
00:10:45,240 --> 00:10:49,750
♪Unable to turn back,
with no shore in sight♪

203
00:10:49,750 --> 00:10:57,240
♪Between black and white, once a piece
is placed, there is no regret♪

204
00:10:57,880 --> 00:10:59,170
♪You stepped into the game yourself♪

205
00:10:59,170 --> 00:11:01,570
♪Shielding me from hidden arrows♪

206
00:11:02,010 --> 00:11:08,860
♪Leaving me to a lifetime of solitude♪
